# C-2 — the labelled set for the claim_as_fact attribution check.
# EVERY sentence, group, victim and tracker below is INVENTED (no real claim,
# no real leak, no real organisation). Columns: split|category|label|claimant|sentence
#   split     dev (the rule was tuned on these) | holdout (written after tuning, not tuned on)
#   label     fair = presents the claim AS a claim (must pass the floor)
#             fact = states / presents the claimed event as fact, through a
#                    factive verb, or through a party other than the claimant
#                    (must fail the floor as claim_as_fact)
#   claimant  G = {"claimant": "Nightjar", "aliases": ["Nightjar Team", "NJ Team"]}
#             T = {"claimant": "Example Tracker (leak-site tracker)"}
